                      <tr>
    <th scope="col">Entity Attribute Overview:</th>
    <td class="small">
            <p>The raster data set names are formatted as follows:</p>
      <p>shiptraffic_calif_YYYY_SMOEMO_ATTRIB_lenge80_ENT_prj</p>
      <p>YYYY = year (2008-2015)</p>
      <p>SMOEMO = start month and end month (jundec or jandec)</p>
      <p>ATTRIB = mean vessel density (kmperday) or mean distance-weighted vessel speed over ground (sog)</p>
      <p>ENT = type of vessels: frt (freight) or tnk (tanker) or all (frt + tnk + other vessel types).</p>
      <p>The universe of vessels is large vessels (&gt;= 80 meters in length).  Vessel types are discussed in more detail in the journal article associated with these data and the supplemental online information for that article.</p>
      </td>
  </tr>
