            <table class="name-value-table">
                  <tr>
    <th scope="col">Description:</th>
    <td class="small">
            <p>The data were processed and analyzed with ArcGIS Desktop version 10.4.1 software and the Spatial Analyst extension in a Windows 7 environment.  The data are stored as raster data sets in a file geodatabase.  The overall size of the file geodatabase is about 112 MB.</p>
