    <th scope="col">Completeness Report:</th>
    <td class="small">
            <p>Some days of data were missing in a few years, and especially in the first year (2008) of data collection/archiving by the USCG.</p>
      </td>
  </tr>
                                    <tr>
    <th scope="col">Quality Control Procedures Employed:</th>
    <td class="small">
            <p>The data processing methods and quality control procedures are discussed in the following journal article and supplemental online information published with the article:</p>
      <p>Moore, T.J., Redfern, J.V., Carver, M., Hastings, S., Adams, J.D., Silber, G.K., 2018. Exploring ship traffic variability off California. Ocean &amp; Coastal Management 163, 515-527. DOI: 10.1016/j.ocecoaman.2018.03.010</p>
